{"id":"c7eb8062267a38da","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-measure8-poisson-boundary.md","title":"ZFC Measure8 Poisson Boundary","display":"df-zfc-measure8-poisson-boundary — ZFC Measure8 Poisson Boundary","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure8-poisson-boundary","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure8-poisson-boundary"],"display":"df-zfc-measure8-poisson-boundary — ZFC Measure8 Poisson Boundary","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure8-poisson-boundary"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure8-poisson-boundary</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure8-poisson-boundary — ZFC Measure8 Poisson Boundary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_G\\in G\">\\(e_G\\in G\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|G|\\leq\\omega\">\\(|G|\\leq\\omega\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProbabilitySpace}_S(G,\\mathcal P(G),\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProbabilitySpace}_S(G,\\mathcal P(G),\\mu)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProbabilitySpace}_S(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProbabilitySpace}_S(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in B^{G\\times B}\">\\(a\\in B^{G\\times B}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\subseteq\\mathbb R^G\">\\(H\\subseteq\\mathbb R^G\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\\in L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)\">\\(\\xi\\in L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in H^{L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)}\">\\(T\\in H^{L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> (map predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8PoissonBoundary}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8PoissonBoundary}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\xi\\in L^\\infty(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu):\\forall f\\in\\xi\\;(f\\in\\mathbb R^B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\xi\\in L^\\infty(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu):\\forall f\\in\\xi\\;(f\\in\\mathbb R^B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}poisson\\text{-}boundary}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8PoissonBoundary}_S(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu,a,G,\\cdot_G,e_G,\\mu,H,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land e_G\\in G\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot_Gg=g\\land g\\cdot_Ge_G=g)\n\\land|G|\\leq\\omega\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProbabilitySpace}_S(G,\\mathcal P(G),\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProbabilitySpace}_S(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)\n\\land a\\in B^{G\\times B}\n\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;(a(e_G,b)=b)\n\\land\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(a(g\\cdot_Gh,b)=a(g,a(h,b)))\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(a(g,-);(B,\\Sigma_B),(B,\\Sigma_B))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\forall A\\in\\Sigma_B\\;\n\\bigl(\\nu(A)=0\\to\\nu(\\{b\\in B:a(g,b)\\in A\\})=0\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\Sigma_B\\;\n\\left(\\nu(A)=\\sum_{g\\in G}\\mu(\\{g\\})\\,\\nu(\\{b\\in B:a(g,b)\\in A\\})\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nH\n=\\left\\{u\\in\\mathbb R^G:\n\\sup_{g\\in G}|u(g)|&lt;\\infty\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\nu(g)=\\sum_{h\\in G}\\mu(\\{h\\})u(g\\cdot_G h)\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(T,L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu),H)\n\\land\n\\forall\\xi\\in L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)\\;\\forall f\\in\\xi\\;\\forall g\\in G\\;\nT(\\xi)(g)=\\int_B f(a(g,b))\\,d\\nu(b)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Bijective}(T,L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu),H)\n\\land\n\\forall\\xi\\in L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)\\;\\forall f\\in\\xi\\;\n\\sup_{g\\in G}|T(\\xi)(g)|\n=\\inf\\{c\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}:\\nu(\\{b\\in B:|f(b)|&gt;c\\})=0\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}poisson\\text{-}boundary}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8PoissonBoundary}_S(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu,a,G,\\cdot_G,e_G,\\mu,H,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land e_G\\in G\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot_Gg=g\\land g\\cdot_Ge_G=g)\n\\land|G|\\leq\\omega\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProbabilitySpace}_S(G,\\mathcal P(G),\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProbabilitySpace}_S(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)\n\\land a\\in B^{G\\times B}\n\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;(a(e_G,b)=b)\n\\land\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(a(g\\cdot_Gh,b)=a(g,a(h,b)))\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(a(g,-);(B,\\Sigma_B),(B,\\Sigma_B))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\forall A\\in\\Sigma_B\\;\n\\bigl(\\nu(A)=0\\to\\nu(\\{b\\in B:a(g,b)\\in A\\})=0\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\Sigma_B\\;\n\\left(\\nu(A)=\\sum_{g\\in G}\\mu(\\{g\\})\\,\\nu(\\{b\\in B:a(g,b)\\in A\\})\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nH\n=\\left\\{u\\in\\mathbb R^G:\n\\sup_{g\\in G}|u(g)|&lt;\\infty\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\nu(g)=\\sum_{h\\in G}\\mu(\\{h\\})u(g\\cdot_G h)\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(T,L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu),H)\n\\land\n\\forall\\xi\\in L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)\\;\\forall f\\in\\xi\\;\\forall g\\in G\\;\nT(\\xi)(g)=\\int_B f(a(g,b))\\,d\\nu(b)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Bijective}(T,L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu),H)\n\\land\n\\forall\\xi\\in L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)\\;\\forall f\\in\\xi\\;\n\\sup_{g\\in G}|T(\\xi)(g)|\n=\\inf\\{c\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}:\\nu(\\{b\\in B:|f(b)|&gt;c\\})=0\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Poisson transform is applied to an almost-everywhere equivalence class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\">\\(\\xi\\)</span> through each representative <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\xi\">\\(f\\in\\xi\\)</span>; stationarity makes the displayed value representative-independent.</li>\n<li>The final infimum is the essential-supremum norm, so no equivalence class is incorrectly applied as though it were a pointwise function.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)$, $e_G\\in G$, and $|G|\\leq\\omega$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-group.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProbabilitySpace}_S(G,\\mathcal P(G),\\mu)$ and $\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProbabilitySpace}_S(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measurable}_S$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)","display":false},{"tex":"e_G\\in G","display":false},{"tex":"|G|\\leq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProbabilitySpace}_S(G,\\mathcal P(G),\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProbabilitySpace}_S(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in B^{G\\times B}","display":false},{"tex":"H\\subseteq\\mathbb R^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi\\in L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\in H^{L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8PoissonBoundary}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\xi\\in L^\\infty(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu):\\forall f\\in\\xi\\;(f\\in\\mathbb R^B)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}poisson\\text{-}boundary}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8PoissonBoundary}_S(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu,a,G,\\cdot_G,e_G,\\mu,H,T)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land e_G\\in G\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot_Gg=g\\land g\\cdot_Ge_G=g)\n\\land|G|\\leq\\omega\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProbabilitySpace}_S(G,\\mathcal P(G),\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8ProbabilitySpace}_S(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)\n\\land a\\in B^{G\\times B}\n\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;(a(e_G,b)=b)\n\\land\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(a(g\\cdot_Gh,b)=a(g,a(h,b)))\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(a(g,-);(B,\\Sigma_B),(B,\\Sigma_B))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\forall A\\in\\Sigma_B\\;\n\\bigl(\\nu(A)=0\\to\\nu(\\{b\\in B:a(g,b)\\in A\\})=0\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\Sigma_B\\;\n\\left(\\nu(A)=\\sum_{g\\in G}\\mu(\\{g\\})\\,\\nu(\\{b\\in B:a(g,b)\\in A\\})\\right)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\nH\n=\\left\\{u\\in\\mathbb R^G:\n\\sup_{g\\in G}|u(g)|<\\infty\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\nu(g)=\\sum_{h\\in G}\\mu(\\{h\\})u(g\\cdot_G h)\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(T,L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu),H)\n\\land\n\\forall\\xi\\in L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)\\;\\forall f\\in\\xi\\;\\forall g\\in G\\;\nT(\\xi)(g)=\\int_B f(a(g,b))\\,d\\nu(b)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Bijective}(T,L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu),H)\n\\land\n\\forall\\xi\\in L^\\infty_{\\mathbb R}(B,\\Sigma_B,\\nu)\\;\\forall f\\in\\xi\\;\n\\sup_{g\\in G}|T(\\xi)(g)|\n=\\inf\\{c\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}:\\nu(\\{b\\in B:|f(b)|>c\\})=0\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\xi","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\xi","display":false}],"bytes":3181,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2656","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-measure8-poisson-boundary.md|58-df-zfc-measure8-poisson-boundary]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["0578a357a86e9d8f","ed71f39f59370734","bbbec05fde1d3b01","a1d034d5d39b4a14","36d7463d215be751","d583890235faf0d5"]}